The header and implementation are consistent with each other. The issue is that 
the test suite expects the `frequency` function to take only `const 
std::vector<std::string>& texts` (no `num_threads` parameter). The parallelism 
should be handled internally based on the number of hardware threads.



Let me update the header to remove the `num_threads` parameter and update the 
implementation accordingly.



parallel_letter_frequency.h

