I'll use a scoring approach where each hand gets a comparable tuple of values.



Key considerations:

- Card parsing: rank char (2-9, T, J, Q, K, A) + suit char (any single char)

- Ranks mapped to values 2-14

- Straight detection including wheel (A-2-3-4-5) where A acts as low (value 1)

